# Production Data API grants snapshot, public schema (project AppFeeder).
# Captured 2026-10-22 with read-only catalog queries (pg_class.relacl via
# aclexplode); no column-level ACLs exist in production. Format:
#   relname|relkind|anon=<p> authenticated=<p> PUBLIC=<p> service_role=<p>
# privilege letters: a=INSERT r=SELECT w=UPDATE d=DELETE D=TRUNCATE
# x=REFERENCES t=TRIGGER m=MAINTAIN U=USAGE ('-' = none).
# OUT_OF_REPO marks objects created outside supabase/migrations (other
# apps sharing the project); a fresh rebuild does not create them.
_deploy_flags|r|anon=arwdDxtm authenticated=arwdDxtm PUBLIC=- service_role=arwdDxtm
